WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.632
Let's create a gift with purchase in the Fieldnote
demo store. Spend fifty dollars and receive one Sun

2
00:00:06.632 --> 00:00:07.369
notebook free.

3
00:00:07.719 --> 00:00:14.287
We will build the campaign, enable Gift Auto-Add in an
unpublished theme, and check the real cart and

4
00:00:14.287 --> 00:00:14.652
checkout.

5
00:00:15.702 --> 00:00:21.799
Choose New campaign, then Gift offer. Give the
campaign a descriptive name and keep it automatic, so

6
00:00:21.799 --> 00:00:24.310
shoppers do not need a discount code.

7
00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:31.800
In Conditions, choose Cart value. This example uses
the store's U.S. dollar currency. Leave extra

8
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.608
targeting and restrictions unchanged for this first
test.

9
00:00:35.958 --> 00:00:42.525
If you later sell in other currencies or combine
offers, configure and test those rules separately. A

10
00:00:42.525 --> 00:00:46.775
working U.S. dollar example is not a check of every
market.

11
00:00:47.825 --> 00:00:54.061
In Rewards, set the minimum cart amount to fifty
dollars and the gift discount to one hundred percent.

12
00:00:54.061 --> 00:00:56.487
Select the Sun notebook as the gift.

13
00:00:56.837 --> 00:01:03.465
Use a fixed quantity of one and enable automatic gift
addition. We are giving one configured product, not

14
00:01:03.465 --> 00:01:05.307
every product in a pool.

15
00:01:05.657 --> 00:01:11.734
Leave Mystery Gift off for this walkthrough. Review
the conditions and reward, then save as an inactive

16
00:01:11.734 --> 00:01:13.879
draft while you prepare the theme.

17
00:01:14.929 --> 00:01:22.606
In Online Store, open Themes and edit the theme you
want to test. We are using a disposable unpublished

18
00:01:22.606 --> 00:01:25.435
copy, leaving the original demo theme unchanged.

19
00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:33.406
Open App embeds and enable Gift Auto-Add, then save.
This is an app embed, not the Quantity Tiers or Cart

20
00:01:33.406 --> 00:01:34.168
Progress block.

21
00:01:34.518 --> 00:01:41.287
Preview this same theme. The embed adds an eligible
gift; the campaign defines when it qualifies and how

22
00:01:41.287 --> 00:01:46.175
it is discounted. Both the theme setup and the active
campaign are needed.

23
00:01:47.225 --> 00:01:53.409
Return to the saved draft and activate this test
campaign. Start with an empty cart in the theme

24
00:01:53.409 --> 00:01:53.753
preview.

25
00:01:54.103 --> 00:02:00.681
Two Coral notebooks cost forty-eight dollars, below
our fifty-dollar minimum. No free gift should appear.

26
00:02:01.031 --> 00:02:07.934
Increase the paid quantity to three. The purchase is
now seventy-two dollars. One Sun notebook should be

27
00:02:07.934 --> 00:02:12.806
added automatically, without pressing checkout, and
its final price must be free.

28
00:02:13.856 --> 00:02:20.826
Open checkout and confirm three Coral notebooks and
one free Sun notebook. The merchandise amount remains

29
00:02:20.826 --> 00:02:24.746
seventy-two dollars, with twelve dollars saved on the
gift.

30
00:02:25.096 --> 00:02:31.528
Check the real product quantities as well as the
totals. Delivery and taxes may be separate. We do not

31
00:02:31.528 --> 00:02:35.591
enter customer or payment details, and we do not place
an order.

32
00:02:36.641 --> 00:02:43.581
Return to the cart and remove the free gift. For this
unchanged purchase, it should stay removed, including

33
00:02:43.581 --> 00:02:46.666
after a refresh. The app respects that choice.

34
00:02:47.016 --> 00:02:53.855
Now change the qualifying purchase by adding another
Coral notebook. This new eligible cart can receive one

35
00:02:53.855 --> 00:02:58.683
gift again. It must not create duplicate gifts or a
refresh loop.

36
00:02:59.033 --> 00:03:05.744
Remove the qualifying purchase and confirm its gift is
cleaned up. Repeat the add and removal check, then

37
00:03:05.744 --> 00:03:07.236
leave the cart empty.

38
00:03:07.586 --> 00:03:14.419
Keep your own theme unpublished until these checks
pass. Our temporary campaign and recording theme are

39
00:03:14.419 --> 00:03:17.835
removed after filming; the original demo remains
unchanged.
